sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant H as Agent / Harness
    participant S as Session
    participant M as LLM
    participant T as Tools / Environment

    U->>H: 输入一个 step
    H->>S: append(user input)
    H->>M: messages + tool schemas
    M-->>H: tool call 或 final answer
    opt 返回 tool call
        H->>T: 在策略边界内执行
        T-->>H: tool result
        H->>S: append(tool result)
        H->>M: 带结果继续推理
    end
    H->>S: append(output)
    H-->>U: 返回结果，等待下一 step
